{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1558681-a-hunter-the-reckoning-game-by-the-robocop-rogue-city-devs-just-got-leaked","id":1558681,"title":"A Hunter the Reckoning Game by the Robocop Rogue City Devs just got leaked","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","World of Darkness"],"posts":[{"date":"2026-03-06T08:35:52-08:00","id":1558681,"title":"A Hunter the Reckoning Game by the Robocop Rogue City Devs just got leaked","content":"Based on what people have said about the leaked files before they took down the botched update that leaked it, it looks like it\u2019s gonna be a shooter with RPG elements much like rogue city. <a href=\"https://www.reddit.com/r/GamingLeaksAndRumours/s/KIQGIKS7Jv\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.reddit.com/r/GamingLeaks...s/s/KIQGIKS7Jv</a>","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-07T15:29:22-08:00","id":1558713,"title":"","content":"It's a tricky situation. So, yes, this awkward leak happened. But it's better to be skeptical right now whether this is an actual leak of an upcoming game-release. First, there's the recent pivot from Paradox away from non-grand-strategy-games, so who knows whether Paradox cancelled the game or not (or just didn't want to support it as much as it had promised before). The second issue is that Nacon, the publisher of the mentioned game Robocop: Rogue City has recently <a href=\"https://www.pcgamer.com/gaming-industry/styx-publisher-nacon-files-for-insolvency-just-a-week-after-we-gave-its-latest-game-82-percent-asks-white-knuckling-creditors-to-figure-out-whats-next-in-a-calm-and-constructive-framework/\" target=\"_blank\">filed for insolvency</a>. This leads to a big question-mark regarding the idea that this game will ever get to see the light of day or whether it had already been cancelled in the past.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-27T12:46:17-07:00","id":1559047,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://youtu.be/xXh9l5dGnnA?si=o5Ns5CnluyxSHxSt\" data-code=\"xXh9l5dGnnA\" data-provider=\"youtube_share\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/xXh9l5dGnnA/maxresdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div> looks like it is still in development after all.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Despite the user name I am actually bigender.<br /> <br /> My Savannah Setting for CofD can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/959455-the-young-man-in-the-cafe-s-savannah-georgia-setting-writeup\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><br /> <br /> My heroes as monster tamers rules for BtP can be found <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/975230-heroes-as-monster-tamers-rules-ideas\" target=\"_blank\">here</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/3932-the-young-man-in-the-cafe","name":"The young man in the cafe","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar3932_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Sep 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1097"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-29T13:59:52-07:00","id":1559099,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"videocontainer with-aspect-ratio videocontainer-horizontal\" style=\"aspect-ratio: 16/9;\"> <a class=\"video-frame\" href=\"https://www.youtube.com/watch?v=pGb_nQZrvFU\" data-code=\"pGb_nQZrvFU\" data-provider=\"youtube\" data-height=\"0\" data-width=\"0\" itemprop=\"video\"> <div class=\"videothumbnail\" style=\"\"> <img src=\"https://img.youtube.com/vi/pGb_nQZrvFU/hqdefault.jpg\" alt=\"\" /> <div class=\"videothumbnailoverlay\"></div> </div> </a> </div>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-29T14:29:44-07:00","id":1559100,"title":"","content":"I'm confused at why they're changing genres of an existing video game franchise... again. How is an action adventure FPS monster hunting game supposed to stand out in the current market? It might not suffer the big issue of having BL2's budget hanging over its head, but HtR had a successful run of video games already in a different genre. So just like VtM videogame players that were expecting more RPG elements, this is going to lose HtR fans that want some twin-stick shooter aspects.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-29T14:33:51-07:00","id":1559101,"title":"","content":"What I find remarkable here is just how insanely unlucky the whole thing feels. So, Paradox abandoned everything that isn't part of their core-portfolio (grand-strategy and the like) and with WPOD they'd keep the license but they would keep the videogame-part at arm's length, so to speak. First example of that: This Hunter game. Nacon is the publisher and Treyon is the developer.<br /> <br /> They couldn't have picked a worse publisher, though. I don't think it was deliberate but that's what ended up happening here, I guess. Nacon is going through an insolvency-procedure that could last up to the next 18 months. Good news is that Treyon (the developer) isn't owned by Nacon, so it's not like it's up on the chopping-block for this procedure. But who knows what will be left at the end of this process... And of course, one possible solution could be for Paradox to simply jump in and take over (as publisher) - except that's exactly what Paradox promised they wouldn't do anymore after the failure of Bloodlines 2. <br /> <br /> And hopefully, Nacon's troubles won't impact the development too much... but do I fear that they will? Of course I do. Especially as long as I don't see gameplay. <br /> <br /> Also, the idea that the next bigger WOD-videogame-release to Bloodlines 2 would be <i>yet another game with a deeply troubled development</i> like this one...","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/27535-knightingale","name":"Knightingale","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar27535_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Aug 2022"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1492"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2026-03-29T20:58:41-07:00","id":1559112,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Heavy Arms</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-classic-world-of-darkness/1558681-a-hunter-the-reckoning-game-by-the-robocop-rogue-city-devs-just-got-leaked?p=1559100#post1559100\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm confused at why they're changing genres of an existing video game franchise... again. How is an action adventure FPS monster hunting game supposed to stand out in the current market? It might not suffer the big issue of having BL2's budget hanging over its head, but HtR had a successful run of video games already in a different genre. So just like VtM videogame players that were expecting more RPG elements, this is going to lose HtR fans that want some twin-stick shooter aspects.</div> </div> </div> </div>But you don't understand! It's so much deeper and more profound this way! Can't you feel the PERSONAL HORROR?<br /> <br /> [/sarcasm]","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/23-saur-ops-specialist","name":"Saur Ops Specialist","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar23_3.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"9371"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}